{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"scc6b79b93c1c60d1","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-fad55482901d7ee84dc0","text":"今日の写真は撮れた？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-77faabfe70f725d0d83b","text":"[開拓者]？いないの？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-33b147b28ad4720d636d","text":"（写真を見せる）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7295d558282437937dac","text":"路面電車にぶつかった","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-71a909b41b1570e22eff","text":"さっき路面電車に撥ねられた","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d3481bd6e4c284e1b05b","text":"防御ステータスをいっぱい積んでたから、何とか大丈夫だったけど…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-727c29c85cae6e497b9f","text":"！！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6522ea1e398144625465","text":"ちょっと、気をつけてよ！！！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-57fc2ae5f03db1c3e1eb","text":"敵と戦ってた","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-1f01710e16bf8e32bb70","text":"さっき戦ってたら","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-30a2c7517481a3a8e43e","text":"路面電車と同じ顔をした敵に遭った","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e37fb638c771a147f5f7","text":"そんな敵いるの？ちょっと気になる……","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ac414cafc7a1f8fbbb7c","text":"次は一緒に撮って見せて～！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a9e771b459f51d14eeb7","text":"撮影に夢中になりすぎた","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-eed6e94ab9368710ea6e","text":"写真を撮るのに夢中になりすぎ{F#ちゃった}{M#た}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f19665b41e0b06e134c9","text":"そんなに写真を好きになってくれたんだ","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ce83a64062b7d709e50a","text":"これからの旅でも一緒に写真を撮ってくれるよね","speaker":""}]}
